---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith("/")
  ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL
  : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Personal Retreats | Still Ground"
  description="A private weekend retreat for one guest at a time in Jane's North Norfolk home, with personal attention, gentle practice and space to rest."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">One guest at a time</p>
      <h1>A weekend that is yours</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Come and spend a peaceful weekend with me in my North Norfolk home.
        This is a private retreat for one guest at a time, shaped around what
        you need. There is room to rest, reflect, practise or simply be, without
        pressure to achieve anything.
      </p>
      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="button" href="mailto:hello@stillground.co.uk">Enquire</a>
        <a class="button secondary" href={`${base}work-with-jane/`}>Meet Jane</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="hero-media image-contain">
      <img
        src={`${base}assets/personal-retreats/beach-retreat.webp`}
        alt="Open beach, sea, and sky for a spacious personal retreat"
        width="760"
        height="570"
        decoding="async"
        fetchpriority="high"
      />
      <figcaption>A spacious weekend in Norfolk, with beach and rural walks available</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="statement">
    <p>
      You do not have to follow a programme or take part in everything. We can
      find a gentle rhythm together, with plenty of time that is entirely your
      own.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="feature-grid" aria-label="What makes the retreat different">
    <article>
      <h3>Just you</h3>
      <p>One guest at a time, in my own home, with privacy and personal attention.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h3>Your own pace</h3>
      <p>There is no rigid timetable. Walk, rest, read, journal or do nothing at all.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h3>Care without pressure</h3>
      <p>I can offer guidance and company when you want them, and quiet when you need space.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-narrow">
    <h2>Here, as you are</h2>
    <p>
      I have spent decades with meditation, yoga, healing and deep listening.
      Those experiences inform how I welcome people, but I am more interested in
      you than in fitting you into an idea of what a retreat should be. We can
      talk, practise or spend time together when that helps, and I will respect
      your privacy and independence when you want to be alone.
    </p>
    <p>
      My hope is that you feel comfortable enough to slow down and reconnect
      with yourself. You bring yourself, just as you are; I will bring my
      attention and care.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Included</p>
      <h2>Make yourself at home</h2>
      <p>
        You will have a private ensuite room, home-cooked meals and a welcoming
        place to settle. Meditation and gentle movement are there if they feel
        right for you, balanced by time to rest, read, reflect or simply be.
      </p>
      <ul class="list-clean">
        <li>Private ensuite room in a peaceful North Norfolk home.</li>
        <li>Home-cooked vegan, gluten-free meals prepared with care.</li>
        <li>Optional morning meditation and evening practice.</li>
        <li>Optional gentle stretches or movement.</li>
        <li>Time outdoors, including countryside or coastal walks if you enjoy them.</li>
        <li>Robe, slippers, herbal teas, and space to feel at home.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="price-panel">
      <p class="small-label">Investment</p>
      <div id="retreat-intro-offer" hidden>
        <p class="small-label">Introductory offer</p>
        <strong>&pound;775</strong>
        <p>For bookings completed by 31 March 2027.</p>
      </div>
      <p>Standard price: <b>&pound;875</b></p>
      <p>All-inclusive weekend retreat, Friday 4pm to Sunday 4pm.</p>
      <p>Location: Aylsham, North Norfolk.</p>
      <p>Vegan and gluten-free. Other dietary needs accommodated with notice.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script is:inline>
    const offer = document.getElementById("retreat-intro-offer");
    const offerExpiry = Date.parse("2027-04-01T00:00:00+01:00");
    const updateOffer = () => {
      if (!offer) return;
      const remaining = offerExpiry - Date.now();
      if (remaining <= 0) {
        offer.remove();
        return;
      }
      offer.hidden = false;
      window.setTimeout(updateOffer, Math.min(remaining, 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000));
    };
    updateOffer();
  </script>

  <section class="section">
    <p class="eyebrow">Sample rhythm</p>
    <h2>A weekend with room to breathe</h2>
    <p>
      This is a possible shape, not a timetable you have to keep. We can choose
      together what feels most nourishing, and there will always be time that
      is simply yours.
    </p>
    <div class="schedule">
      <article>
        <h3>Friday evening</h3>
        <p>Arrive, settle in and share a welcome supper. There is no need to rush into anything.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Saturday</h3>
        <p>
          We might meditate, move gently or go outside. You can also rest,
          read, journal or spend the day quietly. We will share a home-cooked
          dinner in the evening.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Sunday</h3>
        <p>
          There is room for another practice or a quiet morning, followed by
          breakfast, a light lunch and departure when you are ready.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p>
      There may be time to walk along the coast or through the beautiful North
      Norfolk countryside. If you enjoy walking, we can make this part of our
      time together, using it as another opportunity to explore awareness and
      mindfulness outdoors. As with everything else over the weekend, we can
      shape this around you, your interests and what feels right.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section testimonial-section">
    <h2>Kind words from guests and participants</h2>
    <p>These words come from meditation teaching and earlier weekends, not from this personal retreat.</p>
    <div class="testimonial-grid">
      <blockquote>
        <p>
          Jane is lovely and tries to tailor the weekend to your specific desire.
          The food was delicious. The accommodations were clean and comfortable.
          I really liked the meditation aspect of the weekend.
        </p>
        <cite>Marta K., Canada - meditation weekend guest, 14 May 2019</cite>
      </blockquote>
      <blockquote>
        <p>
          I had no experience of meditating at the outset, but I need not have
          worried. Jane guides with kindness and insight. It has been fascinating
          getting to know myself and learning to be quietly at one with myself.
        </p>
        <cite>Paula - Awakening Dignity participant, 2026</cite>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact-band">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Fit matters</p>
      <h2>A pre-retreat conversation is always offered</h2>
      <p>
        Tell me what you are hoping for. We can talk before you decide whether
        this is the right experience for you.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a class="button" href="mailto:hello@stillground.co.uk">Email Jane</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
